# Graphify CRM - Enterprise CRM + HRMS + Payroll Platform

## Vision

Graphify is an all-in-one business operating system that combines:

* CRM
* Project Management
* HRMS
* Attendance Management
* Payroll Management
* Document Management
* Microsoft 365 Integration
* Internal Communication
* Analytics & Reporting

The goal is to provide a single dashboard while leveraging Microsoft 365 infrastructure behind the scenes.

