# 3. Document Management Module

## Storage Strategy

DO NOT store files inside CRM storage.

Store files inside Microsoft SharePoint.

### Workflow

```text
User Uploads File
        ↓
Graphify CRM
        ↓
Microsoft Graph API
        ↓
SharePoint
        ↓
File URL Stored in CRM
```

### Features

* Upload Files
* Version History
* File Preview
* Folder Permissions
* File Sharing
* Document Search
* Approval Workflow

### Project Structure

```text
Projects
 ├── Project A
 │    ├── Contracts
 │    ├── Designs
 │    ├── Reports
 │    └── Invoices
 │
 └── Project B
```

