# RazorpayX Integration

## Purpose

Salary Disbursement

### Workflow

```text
Payroll Approved
       ↓
RazorpayX API
       ↓
Bank Transfer
       ↓
Employee Account Credited
```

### Important Rule

Never transfer salary automatically.

Use:

```text
Payroll Generated
       ↓
HR Approval
       ↓
Finance Approval
       ↓
RazorpayX Transfer
```

